Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:07.20,Line,,,,,Creative teams don't have a work problem.\NThey have a knowing problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.45,0:00:16.30,Line,,,,,This is NEXUS. Executive clarity, in real\Ntime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.45,0:00:16.30,Tag,,,,,MISSION CONTROL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.55,0:00:22.40,Line,,,,,Every project — intelligent from kickoff\Nto close.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.55,0:00:22.40,Tag,,,,,PROJECTS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.65,0:00:28.00,Line,,,,,See your team with clarity — before they\Nburn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.65,0:00:28.00,Tag,,,,,PEOPLE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:47.80,Line,,,,,Ask it anything. The intelligence at the\Nheart of everything answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:47.80,Tag,,,,,CORE INTELLIGENCE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.05,0:00:52.60,Line,,,,,Measurable outcomes, from day one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.05,0:00:52.60,Tag,,,,,BUSINESS IMPACT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.85,0:00:58.70,Line,,,,,And it lives in your pocket —\Nrelationships, not records.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.85,0:00:58.70,Tag,,,,,CLIENTS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:01:05.30,Line,,,,,Every signal that matters, the moment it\Nmatters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:01:05.30,Tag,,,,,NOTIFICATIONS
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.55,0:01:13.90,Line,,,,,Your organization never forgets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.55,0:01:13.90,Tag,,,,,KNOWLEDGE
